sections: intro 1-16, build 17-24, drop1 25-40, break 41-56, build2 57-64, drop2 65-76, switch 77-88, outro 89-104

NOTE The 11 lessons of the track (README.md, the LESSON comments of track.strudel.js) as lesson cues at their bars (CraftCues #164).
Lesson 0 (the half-time grid, 140 bpm, one cycle = one bar) holds for the whole track and is the leading whole-track cue.

